        <source>Description text content with font styles and color</source>
        <target state="translated">描述文本內容，包含字體樣式、顏色等樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPopupRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Popup panel root container with background color, shadow effects, color selection panel, slider controls and preset colors</source>
        <target state="translated">彈出面板根容器，包含背景色、陰影效果、色彩選擇面板、滑塊控制和預設顏色等樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Trigger container with border styles, transition animations, size controls, displaying color block and text content</source>
        <target state="translated">觸發器容器，包含邊框樣式、過渡動畫、尺寸控制等樣式，顯示顏色塊和文本內容</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="StyleClassDescription">
